        question:{prompt:'Where should tenant/document authorization be enforced in a multi-tenant RAG system?',options:['Only in the prompt template','Before retrieval and again before evidence is returned','Only in the browser search filter','After the LLM has generated its answer'],explanation:'Authorization belongs in trusted backend data access and response checks; prompts and client filters are not security boundaries.'},
        project:'Build a retrieval preparation pipeline over a small handbook. Compare fixed-size and heading-aware chunking, record source spans, apply a metadata filter, deduplicate results and assemble a fixed token budget.',
