          question:{prompt:'When is a deterministic workflow preferable to a free-form autonomous planner?',options:['When the process has known steps and strict business rules','Whenever the task contains more than one sentence','When no validation is possible','When the agent needs unrestricted permissions'],explanation:'Known processes are easier to audit, test and operate as deterministic workflows.'},
