          question:{prompt:'What is a key control in a supervisor/specialist architecture?',options:['Allow every specialist to publish independently','Centralize final decisions and side effects in an authorized orchestrator','Share all user memory with every agent','Remove message schemas'],explanation:'A clear orchestrator owns reconciliation and authorized side effects, reducing duplicated or conflicting actions.'},
